{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/196929-webapp-for-creating-angels-spirits-ghosts","id":196929,"title":"Webapp for creating Angels/Spirits/Ghosts","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-07-14T10:10:16-07:00","id":196929,"title":"Webapp for creating Angels/Spirits/Ghosts","content":"I have created a tool to help generate Ephemeral Beings,<br /> as per the rules in the God Machine Rules Update.<br /> <br /> My players have made poor choices and entered infrastructure, after the God Machine had clued on to it being snooped around with.<br /> They walked in after a (possibly literal) bus load of Angels arrived on the scene.<br /> <br /> <br /> In part it was created because I found the rules to be &quot;Non-orthogonal&quot;,<br /> that is changing one thing, eg the Bane results in changing the Rank, which means changing the attributes and numina etc etc.<br /> <br /> It will warn you when you go outside the rules, (Eg not enough/too many numina for the rank),<br /> by marking the section in red. It does not enforce these rules.<br /> For example you may not be using numen from the list in the book,<br /> in which case it is of-course perfectly fine that your numina numbers don't quiet match its calculated.<br /> (I have some vague thoughts I might add a feature that lets you extend the list of numina with your own list from a local file).<br /> <br /> <br /> Defense is calculated cleverly, taking into account the stalwart numen, and also checking if it is a rank 1 spirit.<br /> (I'm kinda pleased with having that corner case covered).<br /> <br /> Ban and Bane helper text updates with the rank, changing. As of-course do all the limits.<br /> <br /> The export button exports all data into a plain text format.<br /> It is designed so I can copy and paste it into MindJets and end up with a well formatted branch for each angel.<br /> <br /> <br /> Largely it was created as a learning exercise -- I learnt Google Dart.<br /> The coding behind it is not great -- I am not doing this again without using a framework for binding.<br /> But doing it this way I did learn alot about the language.<br /> It is also not super pretty. I might get excited about CSS and make it pretty, one day.<br /> <br /> ----<br /> <br /> Anyway, let me know your thoughts.<br /> Perhaps this might be useful to someone.<br /> <br /> Link: <a href=\"http://oxinabox.ucc.asn.au/rpg/eegen/\" target=\"_blank\">http://oxinabox.ucc.asn.au/rpg/eegen/</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1699,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1699-oxinabox","user":"oxinabox","date":". 07-14-2014, 01:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1699-oxinabox","name":"oxinabox","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-14T16:06:26-07:00","id":197245,"title":"","content":"This is really really cool.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: the Ascension - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1191028-redesigned-prime-sphere\" target=\"_blank\">Redesigned Prime Sphere</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1188769-simpler-wonder-creation\" target=\"_blank\">Streamlined Wonder Creation</a><br /> Mummy: the Curse - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/474927-mummy-the-curse-2e-conversion\" target=\"_blank\">Lightweight 2E Conversion</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/22378-second-sight-tradition-disciples-of-duat\" target=\"_blank\">Disciples of Duat</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/61-octavo","name":"Octavo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar61_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-14T19:18:49-07:00","id":197323,"title":"","content":"Dude, that's pretty epic.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1064-miss_minty","name":"miss_minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-14T22:55:26-07:00","id":197569,"title":"","content":"There was a problem that it wasn't possible to spend your numina on dots of influences.<br /> That has now been fixed.<br /> <br /> Same address:<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://oxinabox.ucc.asn.au/rpg/eegen/eegen.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://oxinabox.ucc.asn.au/rpg/eegen/eegen.html\" target=\"_blank\"> nWoD - GMC: Ephemeral Entities Generator </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://oxinabox.ucc.asn.au/rpg/eegen/eegen.html\" target=\"_blank\"> http://oxinabox.ucc.asn.au/rpg/eegen/eegen.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> It also now has some CSS done.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachme